  "ruleText": "Res 8502.01 Applicability. The provisions of Res 8502 shall apply to all bureau trails on department of resources and economic development (DRED) properties as listed in Res 101.06.\n\nSource. #4391-a, eff 3-30-88; EXPIRED 3-30-94\n\nNew. #5946, eff 12-23-94, EXPIRED: 12-23-02\n\nNew. #7457, eff 3-1-01, EXPIRED: 3-1-09\n\nNew. #9478, eff 5-23-09; ss by #10905, eff 8-5-15",
